  <ul>
    <li><a href="#the-pain-sr-11-7-is-causing-our-customers">The pain SR 11-7 is causing our customers</a></li>
    <li><a href="#what-sr-11-7-actually-is">What SR 11-7 actually is</a></li>
    <li><a href="#what-sr-11-7-requires-you-to-do">What SR 11-7 requires you to do</a></li>
