    <li><a href="#what-ai-vendor-disclosure-covers">What AI vendor disclosure covers</a></li>
    <li><a href="#why-ai-vendor-disclosure-matters-to-you">Why AI vendor disclosure matters to you</a></li>
    <li><a href="#what-the-research-says-about-vendor-disclosure">What the research says about vendor disclosure</a></li>
    <li><a href="#how-to-get-compliant-with-vendor-disclosure-a-5-step-path">How to get compliant with Vendor Disclosure: a 5-step path</a></li>
