    <li><a href="#what-the-sec-actually-enforces">What the SEC actually enforces</a></li>
    <li><a href="#what-the-sec-looks-for">What the SEC looks for</a></li>
    <li><a href="#why-sec-ai-enforcement-matters-to-you">Why SEC AI enforcement matters to you</a></li>
    <li><a href="#what-the-research-says-about-sec-ai-enforcement">What the research says about SEC AI enforcement</a></li>
    <li><a href="#how-to-get-compliant-with-sec-ai-enforcement-a-5-step-path">How to get compliant with SEC AI Enforcement: a 5-step path</a></li>
