    <li><a href="#where-the-exposure-actually-sits">Where the exposure actually sits</a></li>
    <li><a href="#what-a-defensible-posture-looks-like">What a defensible posture looks like</a></li>
    <li><a href="#primary-sources-on-sec-ai-enforcement">Primary sources on SEC AI enforcement</a></li>
  </ul>
