  <li><a href="https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-34/subtitle-A/part-99" target="_blank" rel="noopener">34 CFR Part 99 (FERPA regulations)</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://www2.ed.gov/documents/ai-report/ai-report.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US Department of Education, AI and the Future of Teaching and Learning (Office of Educational Technology)</a></li>
</ul>
